  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WERAN kv resurscentr Lgd</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WERAN resource centr Lgd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet g&#xe5;r ut p&#xe5; att stimulera kvinnligt f&#xf6;retagande i Leningrads l&#xe4;n genom att via kunskaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring fr&#xe5;n kvinnliga resurscentra i S&#xf6;rmlands l&#xe4;n etablera liknande centra i Leningrad. Ett 40-tal kvinnliga f&#xf6;retagare kommer f&#xe5; utbildning f&#xf6;r att p&#xe5; sikt etablera resurscentra p&#xe5; tre orter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training in business management for 40 women SMEs in Leningrad oblast to set up three women resource centres in Luga, Schlisselburg and Vyborg to give advice and service to other women SMEs. Will also set up web page and database in order to stimulate business contacts with women SMEs in S&#xf6;dermanland region in Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
